WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:08.458
Sid hid behind a bush.

2
00:00:08.459 --> 00:00:16.348
"I hope Rex doesn't find me," he thought.

3
00:00:16.349 --> 00:00:21.541
Sid heard footsteps.

4
00:00:21.542 --> 00:00:24.689
Then they stopped.

5
00:00:24.690 --> 00:00:28.118
Everything was quiet.

6
00:00:28.119 --> 00:00:29.465
Then . . .

7
00:00:29.466 --> 00:00:36.638
Munch, munch, munch.

8
00:00:36.639 --> 00:00:42.000
"Is Rex eating flowers?" Sid thought.

9
00:00:42.001 --> 00:00:44.629
He peeked.

10
00:00:44.630 --> 00:00:48.680
"Sara!" Sid said.

11
00:00:48.681 --> 00:00:51.037
Sara grinned.

12
00:00:51.038 --> 00:00:57.179
"These flowers are yummy!" she said.

13
00:00:57.180 --> 00:01:01.897
"Where's Rex?" Sid asked.

14
00:01:01.898 --> 00:01:03.879
Sara shrugged.

15
00:01:03.880 --> 00:01:09.100
"Rex almost found me," she said.

16
00:01:09.101 --> 00:01:11.947
"So I ran here.

17
00:01:11.948 --> 00:01:16.767
I found these flowers."

18
00:01:16.768 --> 00:01:22.589
Sid laughed.

19
00:01:22.590 --> 00:01:30.994
He and Sara ate flowers.

20
00:01:30.995 --> 00:01:34.442
"This is a new place," Sid said.

21
00:01:34.443 --> 00:01:37.447
"We were never here before."

22
00:01:37.448 --> 00:01:39.233
Sara nodded.

23
00:01:39.234 --> 00:01:41.660
"Rex won't come here.

24
00:01:41.661 --> 00:01:48.889
It's a perfect hiding spot!"

25
00:01:48.890 --> 00:01:55.805
Sid and Sara walked and ate.

26
00:01:55.806 --> 00:02:01.950
Suddenly Sid bumped into a tree.

27
00:02:01.951 --> 00:02:05.177
Buzz! Buzz!

28
00:02:05.178 --> 00:02:07.974
"Oh no!" Sara said.

29
00:02:07.975 --> 00:02:14.287
"A beehive! Run!"

